# The repo is edited on Windows and run on Linux. A shell script or a
# Caddyfile stored with CRLF fails on the server with a bare
# "bad interpreter: /usr/bin/env bash^M", which reads like a missing binary
# rather than a line-ending problem. Pin the server-side files to LF.
*.sh text eol=lf
Caddyfile text eol=lf
*.service text eol=lf
